{"id":"w_11lpd1ai3em","doc":{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"center","indent":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"这是一款名叫烬明的游戏，是一个用于参加名为Gwueble Jam（ "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://itch.io/jam/gwueble-jam-2026","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","class":null,"title":null}}],"text":"Gwueble Jam - 2026 - itch.io"},{"type":"text","text":" ） 的game jam的小项目。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"indent":0}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"center","indent":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"          这是开箱即玩的网址 "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://while1.itch.io/emberlight","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","class":null,"title":null}}],"text":"EmberLight by While(1)"},{"type":"text","text":"。（可能需要梯子）。"}]},{"type":"figure","attrs":{"src":"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/ENDORF1/endorf1.github.io@main/images/1785086993589-93305.jpg","alt":"","caption":"","width":null,"align":"center","naturalWidth":null,"naturalHeight":null}},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"indent":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"      官方给的开发周期是七天，但已然成为社畜的我，能高强度开发的时间其实只有周末两天。好在我参加的时候主题已经确定：Slow Burn，副主题则是Chair。"},{"type":"hardBreak"},{"type":"text","text":"      这两个主题只要切中一个就算达标。然而我那天才的大脑马上就把他们做了完美的结合--我们来烧家具吧。于是，烬明便诞生了。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"indent":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"      拉上公司的数值策划之后，我们俩按照各自在公司的职位初步规划了一下游戏的设计： "}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":"center","indent":0,"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"一、游戏概述"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"indent":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"游戏名称： 烬明"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"indent":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"主题： Slow Burn"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"indent":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"类型： 俯视角策略解谜游戏"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"indent":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"平台： PC"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"indent":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"一句话描述： 你是一团正在熄灭的余烬，在废墟中用仅剩的火焰点燃障碍、制造连锁反应，烧出一条通往终点的路。"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":"center","indent":0,"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"二、核心设定"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"center","indent":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"背景： 你是一团仍有余温的余烬。你不知道自己为什么要往前走，但你只知道，你必须走出去。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"indent":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"玩家身份： 一团有意识的余烬。你是火种，也是燃料。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"indent":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"慢燃的表达："}]},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"indent":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"燃料从关卡开始持续消耗，不可暂停，不可逆转"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"indent":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"燃料快耗尽时，火焰会忽明忽暗地闪烁——你随时可能熄灭"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"indent":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"每一次引燃障碍，都在加速消耗自己"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"indent":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"但你不引燃障碍，就无路可走"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":"center","indent":0,"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"三、核心玩法"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"indent":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"用仅剩的火，点燃一切能烧的，烧出一条路。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"indent":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"核心循环："}]},{"type":"blockquote","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":"center","indent":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"探索场景 → 发现障碍 → 决定点燃的物品、决定点燃的顺序 → 利用火焰连锁蔓延节省燃料 → 在熄灭前到达出口"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"indent":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"只有一种核心资源：燃料。"}]},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content"